Subject: [PATCH 22/25] =?UTF-8?q?fix(container):=20service=20invoke=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=A2=AB=E9=9D=99=E9=BB=98=E4=B8=A2=E5=BC=83=E2=80=94=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?redirectTo=20=E5=90=8E=E6=89=80=E6=9C=89=20wx.*=20API=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=A4=B1=E6=95=88=E7=9A=84=E7=AC=AC=E4=BA=8C=E6=AE=B5=E6=A0=B9?=
